        "@value": "HHM-Core Product cluster. Close match to DINEN61360:Instance_Description of the HSU DIN EN 61360 ODP, whose expression goal is a requirement. Also the demand side of a manufacturing-as-a-service request (maestro:hasRequirement)."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
