        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Folded in from the MAESTRO 1.0 communication module, a controlled vocabulary of individuals. The individuals are declared in the extension module of their technology (maestro:OpcUaNodeSetIDL in ext/opcua.ttl, maestro:DtdlIDL in ext/dtdl.ttl, maestro:OpenApiIDL in ext/rest.ttl, maestro:AasSubmodelTemplateIDL in ext/digital-twin.ttl); a knowledge graph may declare further individuals. Individuals name the languages; naming AAS submodel templates or OpenAPI is not a conformance claim."
      }
    ],
